# Host-arch dev binaries from `make go-build`. The Dockerfiles only ever consume
# bin/linux_service (the cross-compiled artifact from `make go-build-linux`), so
# shipping these adds ~200MB to every build context for nothing. Keep the
# exclusion this specific - ignoring services/*/bin wholesale would also hide
# linux_service and silently disable the pre-build fast path.
services/*/bin/service
